Some rings (protection, increase damage, and more) have a number
specifying how well it work.  The shopkeeper will probably set different
prices when this number differ. I haven't looked at the source, but it
could happen that this number exist for rings where it isn't relevant,
such as a ring of polymorph control.  Rings with different numbers will of
course not merge in a pile or in the inventory.


